{"id":122,"name":"mr-mime","speciesId":122,"dex":122,"form":"normal","generation":1,"types":["psychic","fairy"],"stats":{"hp":40,"attack":45,"defense":65,"special-attack":100,"special-defense":120,"speed":90},"abilities":[{"name":"soundproof","hidden":false},{"name":"filter","hidden":false},{"name":"technician","hidden":true}],"height":13,"weight":545,"baseExp":161,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/122.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/122.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/122.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/122.ogg","genus":"Barrier Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon de barreira","flavor":[{"version":"red","text":"If interrupted while it is miming, it will slap around the offender with its broad hands."},{"version":"yellow","text":"Always practices its pantomime act. It makes enemies believe something exists that really doesn't."},{"version":"gold","text":"A skilled mime from birth, it gains the ability to create invisi­ ble objects as it matures."},{"version":"silver","text":"Its fingertips emit a peculiar force field that hardens air to create an actual wall."},{"version":"crystal","text":"It uses the mysterious power it has in its fingers to solidify air into an invisible wall."},{"version":"ruby","text":"MR. MIME is a master of pantomime. Its gestures and motions convince watchers that something unseeable actually exists. Once it is believed, it will exist as if it were a real thing."},{"version":"emerald","text":"A MR. MIME is a master of pantomime. It can convince others that something unseeable actually exists. Once believed, the imaginary object does become real."},{"version":"firered","text":"It is adept at conning people. It is said to be able to create walls out of thin air by miming."},{"version":"leafgreen","text":"If interrupted while it is miming, it will suddenly DOUBLESLAP the offender with its broad hands."},{"version":"diamond","text":"It is a pantomime expert that can create invisible but solid walls using miming gestures."},{"version":"pearl","text":"Emanations from its fingertips solidify the air into invisible walls that repel even harsh attacks."},{"version":"platinum","text":"It shapes an invisible wall in midair by minutely vibrating its fingertips to stop molecules in the air."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"A skilled mime from birth, it gains the ability to create invisible objects as it matures."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"Mr. Mime is a master of pantomime. Its gestures and motions convince watchers that something unseeable actually exists. Once the watchers are convinced, the unseeable thing exists as if it were real."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"Its pantomime skills are wonderful. You may become enraptured while watching it, but next thing you know, Mr. Mime has made a real wall."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"It creates invisible walls with its pantomiming. If you don’t act impressed, it will attack you with a double slap!"},{"version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Always practicing its pantomime act. It makes enemies believe something exists that really doesn’t."},{"version":"sword","text":"The broadness of its hands may be no coincidence—many scientists believe its palms became enlarged specifically for pantomiming."},{"version":"shield","text":"It’s known for its top-notch pantomime skills. It protects itself from all sorts of attacks by emitting auras from its fingers to create walls."},{"version":"legends-arceus","text":"The behavior of this clown-like Pokémon reminds one of pantomime. It creates invisible walls using a force emitted from its fingertips."}],"flavorPt":"The behavior of this clown-like Pokémon reminds one of pantomime. Ele cria paredes invisíveis usando uma força emitida pelas pontas dos dedos.","genderRa